#: ../../source/users/drawing/mounting_plate.rst:7
msgid "Design mounting plate"
msgstr "设计安装板"

#: ../../source/users/drawing/mounting_plate.rst:9
msgid ""
"QElectroTech is not only a tool for diagrams and schemas, QElectroTech "
"allows also drawing 2D drawings. Electrical boxes, buttons, switches, "
"screens and any other type of components can be drawn at the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 不仅是用于图和原理图的工具，还允许绘制 2D 图纸。电气箱、按钮、开关、屏幕以及任何其他类型的组件都可以在 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 中绘制。"

#: ../../source/users/drawing/mounting_plate.rst:13
msgid ""
"2D drawings from electrical component can be created at the `element "
"editor`_ as `elements`_. After the creation of component drawings, assembled"
" panel drawings can be created introducing the `elements`_ at the "
"`workspace`_. At the category **Graphics** from `QET collection`_ some "
"common electrical components front views are provided as `elements`_."
msgstr ""
"可以在 `元件编辑器 <element editor_>`_ 中创建电气组件的 2D 图纸，并将其作为 `元件 <elements_>`_ "
"。创建组件图纸后，可以在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中放入 `元件 <elements_>`_ 来创建组装面板图纸。在 `QET 集合 "
"<QET collection_>`_ 的 **Graphics** 类别中，提供了一些常见电气组件的正视图作为 `元件 <elements_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/drawing/mounting_plate.rst:20
msgid ""
"For more information about how to create `elements`_, refer to `Create or "
"edit element`_ section."
msgstr ""
"有关如何创建 `元件 <elements_>`_ 的更多信息，请参阅 `创建或编辑元件 <Create or edit element_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/drawing/mounting_plate.rst:23
msgid ""
"For more information about how to introduce `elements`_ at `workspace`_, "
"refer to `Working with element`_ section."
msgstr ""
"有关如何在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中放入 `元件 <elements_>`_ 的更多信息，请参阅 `使用元件 <Working "
"with element_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/drawing/mounting_plate.rst:26
msgid ""
"The advantage of drawing mounting plates using QElectroTech and not with a "
"different CAD tool is the possibility to create links between the "
"`elements`_. A link between the `elements`_ which represents the electrical "
"component at the `schema`_ and the `elements`_ which represents the "
"component at the drawing will reduce the future effort; the effort from the "
"manufacturing, installation and maintenance phase of the project."
msgstr ""
"使用 QElectroTech 而非其他 CAD 工具绘制安装板的优势在于，可以在 `元件 <elements_>`_ 之间建立链接。将 `原理图 "
"<schema_>`_ 中代表电气组件的 `元件 <elements_>`_ 与图纸中代表该组件的 `元件 <elements_>`_ "
"建立链接，可以减少未来的工作量，即项目制造、安装和维护阶段的工作量。"

#: ../../source/users/drawing/mounting_plate.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Mounting plate example"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 安装板示例"
